  "title": "fluxrig payment switch (two regions)",
  "description": "High-level view of a two-region ISO 8583 authorization switch. Each region hosts a Rack; Racks fail over to the peer region and reach their scheme endpoints. The gears, wires and sockets live in each Rack's detail architecture (drill down from a Rack). Generated from examples/scenarios/payment_switch_two_regions.yaml.",
